<title>BRAZIL: Nearly 60 pct sold at Brazil gov't coffee auction.</title>
<headline>Nearly 60 pct sold at Brazil gov't coffee auction.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian government sold 57.47 percent of the 200,000 60-kg bags of coffee stocks offered in its auction today, said an official from the Banco do Brasil which held the electronic auction.</p>
<p>Prices ranged between 106.00 and 147.57 reais ($102-142) a bag, with the weighted average price 138.01 reais ($133) a bag, the official said.  </p>
<p>Opening and closing prices in reais per bag per lot were as follows.</p>
<p>    QTY	CROP	COLOR	LOCATION     OPENING    CLOSING</p>
