<p>    7,754	 n/a   Mixed	 Sao Paulo	131	131.05</p>
<p>    516	 n/a   Yellowish   Sao Paulo	131	137.20</p>
<p> 21,405   1986/87   Yellowish   Sao Paulo	137	137.11</p>
